  "cache": [
    {
      "key": "ae32627f43a3b1c9a6b9abfd",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "中文一，B卷，听力第1组。每段听两遍，请选择一个答案。",
      "sha256": "489b5bde58196f6854cfb0d51a82e8b53647a4149837fecf0e50933baf907891"
    },
    {
      "key": "f1b1a9a97394ce8724a1568c",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "中文一，B卷，听力第2组。每段听两遍，请选择一个答案。",
      "sha256": "0daaa40c5da94cfb671166dad242da682302303d3ca7ecee72984f516b63297e"
    },
    {
      "key": "bc0fa8e7cbd328e150b994e3",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "中文一，B卷，听力第3组。每段听两遍，请选择一个答案。",
      "sha256": "044535e0aee8426fa7d524f0c2861b2b3f0f412d2ec59631763c5b8ffdf7ae5d"
    },
    {
      "key": "70f6a621764ce969099d6fa1",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "中文一，B卷，听力第4组。每段听两遍，请选择一个答案。",
      "sha256": "122d8dc1f85b7b12dbad8c775f30c3c8e71ac094427c71d7381193199ad0f4b3"
    },
    {
      "key": "b51c31fbc39d4af6648daa24",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我家有五个人：爷爷、爸爸、妈妈、姐姐和我。姐姐在大学读书，我在中学上学。我们都住在一起。",
      "sha256": "57c60d5f08393f2786250cd6025cd9c387c3c4b64b78fef17ef64842280fabf3"
    },
    {
      "key": "34e89f8d03ace2b111d8dc37",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第1题。",
      "sha256": "3895df58b8b6ce61365216490dcb339db3aa7ef168eef8d2098c469073a4cdc2"
    },
    {
      "key": "cc94d9af1bfce222406c0ca0",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "我妈妈是医生，星期六也要去医院。爸爸星期六不工作，在家做饭。我和哥哥下午一起回家吃饭。",
      "sha256": "c2f9b2de9d2da87cf712963067d7970362703d8e887bda87b7f96d8dc1f42c69"
    },
    {
      "key": "1741fb60958696627ba5f0ed",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第2题。",
      "sha256": "39f2c75a46983608745be0da5fe2130f1e77b5cd88f7b9b3928a0a06485a2744"
    },
    {
      "key": "10b9b5339cc9627aec6708dc",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我们拍全家照时，爷爷坐在中间。爸爸站在爷爷左边，妈妈在右边。姐姐和我站在后面。",
      "sha256": "aadb1ff83759a8a6af35622d26fc1d659ba8ecbb79c53c73ad4498eda52d24fe"
    },
    {
      "key": "97e9c8d06f3e0171388ee24b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第3题。",
      "sha256": "74d7fdba0fd9fae146470574deadbd8616eca796fece18aaf8190b3792f4225e"
    },
    {
      "key": "11ff8761881a68fc15ef219f",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "你们好，我姓马，叫马文。我的中文老师姓林。今天王老师带我来这个班，我很高兴认识大家。",
      "sha256": "d5b3e0e39f124658b9811fb7a6046e174022e9dcc443e552416e26f461b2cd56"
    },
    {
      "key": "b25d3caab3d72c3d0347de4b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第4题。",
      "sha256": "cc38e6d168e0664b2b8f98558b26288abcea294390f4e9aa13d8f457ef5a7046"
    },
    {
      "key": "2de89c8dc7f514681e167439",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我们上午在教室上课，中午去学校食堂吃饭。下午下课后，大家常常去操场运动。今天我也去。",
      "sha256": "f37fa75f9d6fd4bb5821ae55da8d6127071c30c344b5c6e37a58c344a3582116"
    },
    {
      "key": "c5b1d9675aba74bbd668ea00",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第5题。",
      "sha256": "057a4202f7d25216a190a84d6056c30f42be93ac60cdc21879a97aaaf19252d9"
    },
    {
      "key": "031a10c6dc82c557238d0a40",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "同学们，请把书包放在椅子上，不要放在地上。桌子上只放书和本子。现在我们开始上课。",
      "sha256": "cb33718645a3c43d9e4b90c6cb603ec9c0fdc158f4bd416fc7397e46973f74d2"
    },
    {
      "key": "5e6c5b336701fe2c48b7fa2f",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第6题。",
      "sha256": "fcc5b0fabad8f1fa79148054a17b60ac8d2cb351d57ed0d5eb073df550e3ee93"
    },
    {
      "key": "e3f055c30aa447473ed12f0c",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "老师，我今天能借三本书吗？",
      "sha256": "8953d24bb01bce7fc883dba98b5bddf10363c2334452bee235565c3ab53307c8"
    },
    {
      "key": "aa1ac3f5da9631c23072fd65",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "每人一次只能借两本。你可以先选两本，明天还书以后再借。",
      "sha256": "b1f7c2227d10b0e840d0bbfb62d4692bcafff8258d988fd2eddffc8d74234791"
    },
    {
      "key": "79e0bdfd02236c1d4253adc0",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第7题。",
      "sha256": "5151859d99f51fb43c1c4ba74a72c7d8898fd12ebdb151ca350243f27169a52c"
    },
    {
      "key": "7e9460cca88d9800639819db",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "今天体育课还在教室吗？",
      "sha256": "10045c0e3d22d46b957c0b6942ab8ee61f8e3db379f7c80ce5c1f86be8273c00"
    },
    {
      "key": "1e9642a1ad6bfa891cd14b03",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "不，今天不下雨，我们去操场上课。",
      "sha256": "2aca67398e00533c905396444158e2f1185ad588adf6345fb463aa94fde6e0fc"
    },
    {
      "key": "59ef7ede781ee2f905d2ea2b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "好的，我叫同学们一起去操场。",
      "sha256": "5bbd4a39a7a283d262af5b904a987b6cd9013622ca9e96421e2bba7855c8f9b2"
    },
    {
      "key": "b431efe26b8c6cc712ef43b8",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第8题。",
      "sha256": "65ff1f952179bc643f6b488a3150eee5a21667f5901053151fd7aeb53f0c7786"
    },
    {
      "key": "e11b8fdfb34e85cb9a9b4ad6",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "大家拿到纸了吗？请先在纸上写名字，再打开书。今天的练习很短，下课前我们一起看答案。",
      "sha256": "224983386edf11bb732863d00d5ee89a79c641e7b2fcbd1842ea90b03ba7641e"
    },
    {
      "key": "76f9b7034e5801a6360f40bd",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第9题。",
      "sha256": "439f37e4f9738e7ac1dc180f588ae4ed900731c0623d4038b9f3533da20c0ada"
    },
    {
      "key": "13793e62356effe66a16aeb9",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "老师，下午两点上课，我想课前问一个问题。",
      "sha256": "1b508ce86eda9f5789eee1e5e61ad9c8e9b30429f8f9c58bce8704888d74d6bc"
    },
    {
      "key": "ddde83d0b8ea4d0a9e5c90dc",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "可以，一点四十五来办公室吧。",
      "sha256": "e194574fdf1fffed299cddb56da875e2816637c6679d40eb24e1e1743edbfc29"
    },
    {
      "key": "c03d26ce21a4b1237ad01ee3",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，我一点四十五到。",
      "sha256": "22b3978be1865cdaec3bfa21843acfed9b5b66d43a7e38eff99b9a110a52c589"
    },
    {
      "key": "86d64da7bc27367110de5cb7",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第10题。",
      "sha256": "a443b83201af7bae91780e167c2fcd53ef523b448bf77dd4ad6b238de2e582d2"
    },
    {
      "key": "5c16b43ddc13aa592625cd5e",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我要两个面包和一杯牛奶。",
      "sha256": "7b5528d2d4ad6af54b9ebd0914da44ea34c8f43db224541eeea928ccce161340"
    },
    {
      "key": "5223b774690ce552358be5e0",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "面包卖完了，还有包子。",
      "sha256": "a086806fb42e03fd824e61c113d2c0573fc0bfb2d3ad5b743b52c58d7b817687"
    },
    {
      "key": "fa312daf45033990151aa4f2",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "那我要两个包子吧，牛奶还是一杯。",
      "sha256": "3e7b83cd535521f31bc1430909f204d1e09296312fdc36d9608bc30eecd395df"
    },
    {
      "key": "63d3dd3f27ad85dca9aa0606",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第11题。",
      "sha256": "09609165ce7b5b5bbc80de6236e7726415e2ab45d65241e1ca3c75ec4a697f32"
    },
    {
      "key": "9f49aaa6ead41d9a0a49dcc2",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "我们这桌要三杯热茶、两杯冷水。热茶给爸爸妈妈和奶奶，冷水给我和弟弟。请不要拿错了。",
      "sha256": "2eca5b56d3e6a4d109cf4e05ea0542cc2ca523bbcd49b42ee8fa20e841ecaeaf"
    },
    {
      "key": "2dbff9b332f7edc61b4c3c18",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第12题。",
      "sha256": "f25ea7d43ed9f81b7dd1af25fa0339498c7d458e79931122755e838f8d314a83"
    },
    {
      "key": "dc3e10baca5b15ad5be9b8c4",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "今天这些苹果怎么样？",
      "sha256": "737acdcbdad3996a12fbd2229130436e055c789e591ba2ca48522084a89ea86f"
    },
    {
      "key": "51370ca43f52fcd7840cefdc",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "有点儿酸，香蕉很甜。",
      "sha256": "b5e01290b4450065a33bb7d449bf9d50bf655ade2c8540ddcb9ec5baf0402ee7"
    },
    {
      "key": "a226b8526bf702d28452d65d",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我想买甜的。那我不要苹果了，买香蕉吧。",
      "sha256": "d14f3c8602a5de0c59c7d9440d695f2cb6c2b9d5e475ba4ae6bc1cb09d39946a"
    },
    {
      "key": "ec1acc6c51d958bc6eb290a5",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第13题。",
      "sha256": "e6515323a9eef38c0320124c2e99d81f002d229d597de7f44a76008521622c43"
    },
    {
      "key": "b15e393e69ee8ab7701e0df1",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "这杯豆浆多少钱？",
      "sha256": "d2363657532df0c18ccebde5524a14e0387bb15f2b3699e2b4c4c73a87d5360b"
    },
    {
      "key": "87c2a3c8331b846c1837aed1",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "九块。",
      "sha256": "333d4a7cf505f4df13dd853660f3182fb5824b969332a80e3753a4c984f99c92"
    },
    {
      "key": "ca943c8f75c3f38777a609c6",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "给你十块。",
      "sha256": "6d3901867c5922a3a28810a4321828973fa0bd3b41ffbcccaf7a90db2c7350ea"
    },
    {
      "key": "1f66bf9c8bbf1c3ff8ef14f7",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "谢谢，找你一块。豆浆有点儿热，请小心。",
      "sha256": "8b0251866cb0e06f1f1a2ae7f5cbbb7d2ac6c1a5353d3ac52f59fa64b03e0fbf"
    },
    {
      "key": "6a9458d981e42c448c56e5d7",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第14题。",
      "sha256": "3c248ca1222db546caafa3ccef0afeb1d63689c8e501a91b906f7c38012bc8f4"
    },
    {
      "key": "a75992cd576642e8f26c796f",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "门口有一件外套、一条围巾和一顶帽子。外套是我的，围巾是姐姐的，帽子是弟弟的。我们都找到了。",
      "sha256": "03528e154fce7c0d722eb0845b3bcece5c80905189ffcc4d68ac151e09af8f45"
    },
    {
      "key": "9d1b8c046279c5b498214791",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第15题。",
      "sha256": "774136cf8893575562e62fc53ca824d970e119df2986004fbc9a795341529ed7"
    },
    {
      "key": "c24cf8c7054a25cfcc7508a6",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "明天上午一起去买东西吧，十点见，好吗？",
      "sha256": "a9fc10c3c46ba6a7b71be964ff63aba1599dc5c4f969908a38f41f133fb7b885"
    },
    {
      "key": "13ed1fb40f5f51e9be725ebe",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "好，我八点吃早饭，十二点要回家。十点见正好。",
      "sha256": "bf9eb3a5ac447638615a47935d14bb6b7ae17fbdba15fad1b03a2e7409d01dbf"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cffbf1010d1e54023057ea9",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第16题。",
      "sha256": "6cbe22b4463ef0127dbcb5957919648ee9b071c97d70d0b85edf327b6a0071df"
    },
    {
      "key": "dd51dd3d73cfb7d170c4652d",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "今天下午什么时候能给你打电话？",
      "sha256": "46a4a3605d92caa43ec2d99d6a6ecb2debd55d56e220f7f66af20445139f07f1"
    },
    {
      "key": "1711d8ec8930d8b7ec56438f",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "三点我在上课，四点到家，五点出去。你四点打给我吧。",
      "sha256": "aace61d939ebfcebfb3606a17de290d098a6f5c6cb33ea6cfc9f864862b80636"
    },
    {
      "key": "61f4d2e4e5f3e0536be36453",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第17题。",
      "sha256": "7b303e3cdea4e6b338b981ca7d27218c5da50fd4e2ca1cb297c3ba0853fbff6b"
    },
    {
      "key": "cbf0d948b1c695d019920b84",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我的白色运动鞋找不到了，你看见了吗？",
      "sha256": "d4e9cef4d8a1557420b8648043ce28251925aec70037a555612d0827a0ef46d4"
    },
    {
      "key": "c32d2991e1c39352a5b65509",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "门口有一双黑色的。",
      "sha256": "063f52a3aa329ec0d8df53dc8cdbcab68512c737b858f1d1e6721a0df4ff736d"
    },
    {
      "key": "760183eeae738878c6fa4de3",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "黑色的是爸爸的，我的白鞋在床下面。",
      "sha256": "40ac97e808985be4aa9c08215e50596f0ab68c6f5aa9f171678b81fdc0025c32"
    },
    {
      "key": "2e9092b1191d42999a9f695d",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第18题。",
      "sha256": "b0832c56a97774c35b538f689f08bf8314e263e14ab809871867bcdede27a70b"
    },
    {
      "key": "c69c490e659e24a35c8ee815",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "你这周有什么活动？",
      "sha256": "88f30f8d453732644ef56f6534b1caf899b039af439547c025c70c49be2dea7d"
    },
    {
      "key": "34660bf999c74740fdb31daa",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "星期三下午去游泳，星期五下午去公园。我喜欢游泳，也喜欢和朋友在公园走走。",
      "sha256": "7b6108877c0b290517e591fc1967b398000a4e4b296280ced3a93544cfad7213"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee9540a1a810afba0a3a7056",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第19题。",
      "sha256": "91a1a230e642a4906da5e058c485a56cf6a1c77b67c899338da1843b7db5066e"
    },
    {
      "key": "d6bf5442f6a17d346d24764c",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "下午先去打球，好吗？",
      "sha256": "607c49747632c75baa061794c25a4193afaa9ec857b0f8c2c0ce83ff2c5ae863"
    },
    {
      "key": "1119bc1f3959a37f84b0f673",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "我想先把这张画画完，然后去打球。",
      "sha256": "fb53bf201f0dd4cc2f7dc6ed9949f5738bf911dc623e607c63ff67760d7f9744"
    },
    {
      "key": "646f25a6dc00dea8c8ce3377",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好的，你画完以后叫我，我在家等你。",
      "sha256": "3d1cefb406ff673847cac068a94229971cdfbe64b5e6df119eb58d4b2abe3d54"
    },
    {
      "key": "689adfbaa5b63ac16b96aac6",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第20题。",
      "sha256": "f2a7aa65a74fad7dc9d19d81d6990ac99260287106ff304656efb599e75400e1"
    },
    {
      "key": "e3f39eb640472bfdf7a1e998",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "你家有几个人？你和谁一起住？",
      "sha256": "40012b35c2b784b9e5f6d9e5fdcb787de108b802fbfed886af54cbb588f4b642"
    },
    {
      "key": "f302b815b8ff1ff635599549",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "周末你喜欢做什么？不喜欢做什么？",
      "sha256": "dd967e9ccf2c6ff80e509ed5a68479609138e59e097848df229d8aebe1d2370f"
    },
    {
      "key": "62e9e9a82790894272c3014d",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "星期五你几点下课？下课后去哪儿？",
      "sha256": "e5468b7b37fcb84d70ff392531057d5a7bb9970d015549b1852c582ea037908f"
    },
    {
      "key": "ad23bf862781dbb9c8be8c23",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "星期天一起看电影，好吗？你上午还是下午有空？",
      "sha256": "5b32b1fa611276dd0a0cc0d768049b6da3730876d3a2407147f8aecdfcba87d5"
    }
  ]
}
